description:
Design a circuit that counts the number of HIGH bits (ones) in a 16-bit input number. The module takes a 16-bit input, processes it through a combinational logic block, and outputs a 4-bit count representing the total number of ones. The counting is performed by shifting the input number right one bit at a time and accumulating the count of set bits in a variable `ones_count`.
module top_module(
    input [15:0] num,
    output reg [3:0] ones_count // Change output to reg type
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [15:0] num,
    output reg [3:0] ones_count // Change output to reg type
);integer i;
reg [15:0] temp;

always @(*) begin
    ones_count = 0;
    temp = num;
    for (i = 0; i < 16; i = i + 1) begin
        ones_count = ones_count + temp[0];
        temp = temp >> 1;
    end
end

endmodule

